MNF15-P1-D D3-B gate log (2026-11-14) — cost-aware admission: NEGATIVE RESULT, P1 CLOSED

Scope (per instruction): one final bounded cache-allocation experiment.
Total budget frozen (8 MiB body + 8 MiB tile); ONLY the body split
varied. Arms: B0 shared arrival-order (shipped default), B1 even 4/4,
B2 value 2/6, B3 zlib-priority 6/2. Balanced keeps the FULL body budget
for its only active probe configuration (zstd) under every arm —
p1d_body_caps() pins Some([0, 8 MiB]) for Profile::Balanced regardless
of the Maximum arm.

Method: matched-environment instrument (p1d_d3b_arms, one process,
fixtures back-to-back), each arm re-running the REAL pick under its
allocation; the D3 census aggregates could not support exact offline
replay (no ordered access trace), so this is the narrowly scoped
instrumented trace. Every arm must reproduce the B0 digest exactly —
all did (served costs are exact either way; identity by construction
and by assertion).

Measured (miss-walls within one matched run):
  gradient:    B0 4458 ms; B1 +4.2%; B2 +8.8%; B3 -0.7%
  screenshot:  B0 2559 ms; B1 -14.8%; B2 -8.4%; B3 -19.4%
  autumn:      B0 1215 ms; B1 +1.7%; B2 +6.1%; B3 +3.6%
  Sum of miss-wall deltas for the strongest arm (B3): ~ -493 ms across
  the three fixtures ≈ 0.1% of the 414.5 s matched Maximum corpus wall
  — an order of magnitude below the 2% promotion hurdle. Encoder walls
  within noise (screenshot B0 64.1 vs B3 63.5 s).

Why the gross 434 ms/MiB frontier collapsed (the displacement accounting
the instruction required):
  1. B0's arrival order is not blind: each hot body's FIRST occurrence
     is stored, so the expensive families' hot heads are already
     retained; the exhausted tail carries far less repeat mass than the
     D3 aggregate suggested.
  2. Displacement is real: capping zstd pushed its law-lattice bodies
     back into fresh probes (gradient punishes every reallocation arm).
  3. Compulsory first misses and the loss of previously retained zstd
     bodies are exactly why the arms underperform the gross estimate.
  4. Cross-run probe-cost variance (e.g. zlib atlas means 10.1 us in
     the D3 record run vs ~2.9 us in this matched run under identical
     execution counts) bounds the ABSOLUTE value of any such estimate;
     only same-run comparisons are decision-grade.

Disposition (Jon's rule): NO admission policy meets the byte-identity +
reproducibility + >2% (or near-zero-complexity) conditions. Recorded as
the negative result. P1 is CLOSED. The shipped default (B0, shared
arrival-order) stays; the allocation machinery (new_capped +
MNF15_P1D_BODY_CAPS) is retained as inert-by-default research
instrumentation (production behavior byte-identical: verify chain 30/30
Maximum + 30/30 Balanced, 810,816 = the anchor, wall 414.2 s = the D2
vintage, fuzz 525/0).

P1 FINAL ladder (all outputs byte-identical to the v1.15.0 references):
  Baseline 1,127.9 s -> Maximum 414.5 s (-63.2%, 2.72x)
  Balanced 165.92 s -> 28.92 s (-82.6%, 5.74x)
  Peak corpus RSS 108.6 MB; compression anchor 810,816 B.
